  description: "Apply these effects, in sequence, based on the number of face-up
    \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monsters with different names in your Extra Deck.\r\n\u25CF
    3+: \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monsters you control gain ATK equal to their own
    Pendulum Scale x 300 this turn.\r\n\u25CF 5+: You can destroy 1 card your opponent
    controls, then if you have an odd Pendulum Scale in your Pendulum Zone, draw
    1 card.\r\n\u25CF 7+: You can Special Summon 1 \"GranSolfachord\" monster from
    your Extra Deck.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Solfachord Symphony\" per turn."
